      "content": "idk i feels like the er is such a big deal and he's not even acting that sick, just slightly warm. if he doesn't develop any other major symptoms overnight, is it really that urgent? like, if the spots don't spread, can we just wait until the morning to call the doctor? i'd rather just manage it at home for tonight with some tylenol and fluids.",
